      <div class="text-[#ff6600] text-xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-wider leading-relaxed drop-shadow-[2px_2px_4px_#330000]">
        It's now safe to turn off<br/>your computer.
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="win95-turn-on-btn"
          class="retro-btn !py-2 !px-6 !text-sm font-bold text-black border-2 border-white shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#ffffff]"
        >
          ⚡ Turn Computer On (Restart)
        </button>
